OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA full profile for actor and BBC Three
OL,7,Fannouncer Ian Kay can be found on The
OL,8,FTV Room's Showreel website.
OL,10,FPaul R. Jackson interviewed Ian about
OL,11,Fhis career over the phone in July 2025.
OL,13,F"I got a scholarship and graduated from
OL,14,Fthe Academy of Live and Recorded Arts
OL,15,Fin 2019.
OL,17,F"I then went to drama school full-time.
OL,18,FWhilst a member of the National Youth
OL,19,FTheatre, I didn't appear in any shows."
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,142,140,120,200,0,100
