OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F141A1768854079
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,GHOW DID YOU GET THE BBC THREE
OL,7,GANNOUNCING JOB?
OL,9,F"The open casting call appeared on
OL,10,FTwitter, without stating who it was
OL,11,Ffor.
OL,13,F"The casting director Andrew Davis was
OL,14,Flooking for quirky young voices for an
OL,15,Fexciting project.
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,142,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14103
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F141A1768854079
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G3/9
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Two to three months later, my agent
OL,7,Fasked me to send a 30-second clip
OL,8,Ftelling a friend about watching a
OL,9,Fprogramme ` I choose Squid Game and
OL,10,Frecorded it whilst on holiday in
OL,11,FLanzarote.
OL,13,F"I got a call saying I was down to the
OL,14,Ffinal 70. I had initially thought
OL,15,Fcontinuity was about moving the props
OL,16,Fabout!
OL,18,F"I was asked to submit another
OL,19,F30-second clip on different programmes.
OL,20,FI was then down to the final thirteen
OL,21,Fand then the final nine.
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,142,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14104
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F141A1768854079
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G4/9
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It took four to five months, before
OL,7,Fbeing told I had got it, but had to
OL,8,Fkeep it quiet until the official
OL,9,Fannouncement in January 2022. I learnt
OL,10,Flater that 1,000 people had applied.
OL,12,F"The bosses didn't want to go down the
OL,13,Ftraditional route of an announcer on
OL,14,Fthe channel.
OL,16,F"We used to write/record on Monday,
OL,17,FTuesday, Thursday and Friday. But we
OL,18,Fnow write in the studio continuity
OL,19,Fbooth on Friday, and record
OL,20,Fannouncement for the next seven days.
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,142,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F141A1768854079
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G5/9
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm from Mansfield, Nottinghamshire,
OL,7,Fand our usual shift is Friday 8am `
OL,8,F6pm.
OL,10,F"But because I live in Mansfield, Phil
OL,11,FVowels agreed I could start at 10am.
OL,12,FThere is a pressure to be creative all
OL,13,Fthe time, and it can be difficult
OL,14,Fintroducing a show that's repeated
OL,15,Fseveral times during a shift.
OL,17,F"I was trained by Ash and we report to
OL,18,FPhil Vowels. He signs off all scripts
OL,19,Ffor compliance etc and then we record
OL,20,Fthem.
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,142,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14106
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F141A1768854079
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G6/9
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I have dyslexia and OCD, so sometimes
OL,7,Fwriting and recording can take more
OL,8,Ftime, but I have a great team who
OL,9,Fsupport me.
OL,11,F"I do get tongue-tied and occasionally
OL,12,Fpronounce names or places wrong, so I
OL,13,Fjust have to take extra precautions.
OL,15,F"We can watch a show before it airs, to
OL,16,Fget the tone right. We don't see the
OL,17,Ffinished sound until it plays out.
OL,19,F"Once on an Actionline back reference,
OL,20,FI was told I sounded too happy, so I
OL,21,Fwas asked to re-record the voiceover."
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,142,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14107
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F141A1768854079
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G7/9
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,GI HAVE HEARD ASHLEIGH WHITFIELD AND
OL,7,GDUNCAN NEWMARCH ON BBC THREE
OL,9,F"Occasionally they might be used to do
OL,10,Fa pick-up after the main pre-records
OL,11,Fhave been done.
OL,13,F"I was once asked to do a voiceover on
OL,14,FBBC Four at short notice, because I
OL,15,Fthink it wasn't on the system.
OL,17,F"There are currently three of us from
OL,18,Fthe original team that started in
OL,19,FFebruary 2022, based in Salford `
OL,20,FChristie, Louise and myself.
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,142,140,120,200,0,100
PN,14108
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F141A1768854079
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G8/9
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We do see the other announcers who are
OL,7,Fin Salford who are working on BBC One
OL,8,Fand BBC Two."
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BShowreel  CRewind FNat Radio
FL,142,140,120,200,0,100
