SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F141A1768854079
OL,1,W~s1z5~k4j5jw=hw1~sj5           G9/9
OL,2,W,.!/*%+.!+.-'*%/"-$+,"-$U,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CInterview with BBC Three announcer Ian
OL,4,CKay
OL,5,
OL,6,GFINALLY, I ASKED ABOUT HIS TRADEMARK
OL,7,G"HI, IT'S LITTLE IAN" INTRODUCTIONS
OL,9,F"My Dad was also called Ian, so I was
OL,10,Falways referred to as 'little Ian' as a
OL,11,Fkid, and also due to my height of 5ft
OL,12,F1in!"
OL,23,EPub: 19-Jan-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
